{"id":"658006","name":"红烧牛肉","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/658006/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"开水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉化开切成小块放碗里备用。","img":"images/658006/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把大葱放入大碗里。","img":"images/658006/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"红烧酱油放在碗里。","img":"images/658006/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放干辣椒及盐备用。","img":"images/658006/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅里放油烧热后倒入牛肉快速翻炒。","img":"images/658006/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入黄豆酱。","img":"images/658006/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入碗料汁搅匀。","img":"images/658006/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入开水盖上盖子慢炖半小时后倒入电饭锅。","img":"images/658006/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入茶叶少许一起炖。","img":"images/658006/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入素鸡一起炖。","img":"images/658006/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"一小时后牛肉炖熟。","img":"images/658006/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"凉凉放入瓶里放在冰箱随吃随取。","img":"images/658006/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/658006/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}